{"id":"612966","name":"香喷喷的土豆盒子","author":"政妈妈","authorId":"210653","desc":"","cover":"images/612966/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"土豆","amount":"3个"},{"name":"猪肉","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"韭菜","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"土豆去皮洗净切成夹片。","img":"images/612966/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"猪肉切碎加入味极鲜酱油。","img":"images/612966/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"加入六月鲜酱油拌匀腌制一会。","img":"images/612966/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"然后加入韭菜碎，油，盐，鸡精拌匀。","img":"images/612966/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"将肉馅夹入土豆夹片中。","img":"images/612966/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"全夹好了。","img":"images/612966/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"粘一层干面粉，再粘一层面糊放入平底锅中煎制。","img":"images/612966/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"煎至两面金黄即可。","img":"images/612966/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"享用吧。","img":"images/612966/step_9.jpg"}],"tips":"煎的时候注意调整火候，以防煎糊了。 \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：不粘锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}